{"3698540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "30 DAYS. ALONE. ADRIFT.", "steam_appid": 3698540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone on board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only engineer on an autonomous cargo ship 🚢 drifting through the South China Sea 🌊 after a system failure ⚡. Engines are silent, communication is lost, and you are left alone, trying to survive and maybe laugh at your situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a challenge, and every container may hold something useful, strange, or hilariously unexpected. Food, tools, weapons, and bizarre items all await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting and base building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft tools, weapons, and shelters. Furnish your cabin 🛏️ and create safe spaces for rest and storing your loot. Broken parts of the ship can also be repurposed for repairs and experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and system repair</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair malfunctioning mechanisms, solve logic puzzles, and try to regain control of the ship. Attention, ingenuity, and engineering skills are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement and transport</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find vehicles like small boats and trolleys to explore the ship faster and access hard-to-reach areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Health and threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor hunger, thirst, fatigue, seasickness, and injuries. First aid kits and medicine help recovery, but dangers like wildlife attacks and accidents lurk on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental state and self-irony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness affects your sanity. Hallucinations and strange sounds can make ordinary objects appear terrifying or comical. Every decision is both a risk and an opportunity for self-irony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the ship or embrace the drift and enjoy the adventure. Will you survive and become the legend of a ship full of strange finds, puzzles, and unexpected humor? Add <strong>30 Days. Alone. Adrift.</strong> to your wishlist and show the ocean 🌊 that an engineer can survive… with style and humor.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone on board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the only engineer on an autonomous cargo ship 🚢 drifting through the South China Sea 🌊 after a system failure ⚡. Engines are silent, communication is lost, and you are left alone, trying to survive and maybe laugh at your situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a challenge, and every container may hold something useful, strange, or hilariously unexpected. Food, tools, weapons, and bizarre items all await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting and base building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to craft tools, weapons, and shelters. Furnish your cabin 🛏️ and create safe spaces for rest and storing your loot. Broken parts of the ship can also be repurposed for repairs and experiments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and system repair</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair malfunctioning mechanisms, solve logic puzzles, and try to regain control of the ship. Attention, ingenuity, and engineering skills are required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement and transport</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find vehicles like small boats and trolleys to explore the ship faster and access hard-to-reach areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Health and threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor hunger, thirst, fatigue, seasickness, and injuries. First aid kits and medicine help recovery, but dangers like wildlife attacks and accidents lurk on board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental state and self-irony</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness affects your sanity. Hallucinations and strange sounds can make ordinary objects appear terrifying or comical. Every decision is both a risk and an opportunity for self-irony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the ship or embrace the drift and enjoy the adventure. Will you survive and become the legend of a ship full of strange finds, puzzles, and unexpected humor? Add <strong>30 Days. Alone. Adrift.</strong> to your wishlist and show the ocean 🌊 that an engineer can survive… with style and humor.</p>", "short_description": "You are the only engineer on board an autonomous cargo ship drifting in the South China Sea 🌊 after a system failure. Explore containers, craft tools, repair mechanisms, furnish your cabin, and survive among dangers, strange finds, and self-irony.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/3891217943542bba12142a945c7f6fe06a588baa/header.jpg?t=1771510432", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698540/0ee5f960e910d01a3e56aeac061b02d79c542d7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771510432", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store